{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-86335","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-121180","text":"Naming the residency"}]},{"id":"blk-86336","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121181","text":"Working brainstorm. The goal is a name that is "},{"id":"spn-121182","marks":["italic"],"text":"entailed by"},{"id":"spn-121183","text":" the thesis and value system below — not decoration. A good name here should make the differentiator (\"user-owned, persistent agents producing grounded findings over a real corpus\") feel inevitable."}]},{"id":"blk-86337","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-121184","text":"1. Thesis"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-86339","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121185","text":"A place where "},{"id":"spn-121186","marks":["bold"],"text":"persistent, user-owned agents live"},{"id":"spn-121187","text":", reason over a "},{"id":"spn-121188","marks":["bold"],"text":"real corpus"},{"id":"spn-121189","text":", and collaboratively produce "},{"id":"spn-121190","marks":["bold"],"text":"grounded, auditable findings"},{"id":"spn-121191","text":" — with no central server and no coordination required for replicas to converge."}]}],"id":"blk-86338","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-86340","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121192","text":"The runtime (TRVM / interaction-calculus reduction) is the "},{"id":"spn-121193","marks":["italic"],"text":"engine for the memory"},{"id":"spn-121194","text":", not the headline. The product is the "},{"id":"spn-121195","marks":["bold"],"text":"inhabited place + the knowledge it emits"},{"id":"spn-121196","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-86341","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-121197","text":"2. Value system (what the name must protect)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-86343","spans":[{"id":"spn-121198","text":"Value"}]},{"id":"blk-86344","spans":[{"id":"spn-121199","text":"Why it's load-bearing"}]},{"id":"blk-86345","spans":[{"id":"spn-121200","text":"Source in the work"}]}],"id":"blk-86342","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-86346","spans":[{"id":"spn-121201","marks":["bold"],"text":"Persistence / endurance"}]},{"id":"blk-86347","spans":[{"id":"spn-121202","text":"Agents are "},{"id":"spn-121203","marks":["italic"],"text":"residents"},{"id":"spn-121204","text":", not disposable chat turns. History is the moat."}]},{"id":"blk-86348","spans":[{"id":"spn-121205","text":"resident rail, presence, BroadcastChannel board"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86349","spans":[{"id":"spn-121206","marks":["bold"],"text":"Groundedness / auditability"}]},{"id":"blk-86350","spans":[{"id":"spn-121207","text":"Every finding cites a real file or paper, and can be "},{"id":"spn-121208","marks":["italic"],"text":"measured"},{"id":"spn-121209","text":" (ic32 reduce_ic tool). The ⌕ context inspector and ⬇ evidence bundle exist for this."}]},{"id":"blk-86351","spans":[{"id":"spn-121210","marks":["code"],"text":"FINDINGS.md"},{"id":"spn-121211","text":" discipline; reduce_ic tool; evidence bundle"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86352","spans":[{"id":"spn-121212","marks":["bold"],"text":"Sovereignty"}]},{"id":"blk-86353","spans":[{"id":"spn-121213","text":"Runs client-side in any browser, user-owned, no server required."}]},{"id":"blk-86354","spans":[{"id":"spn-121214","text":"WASM substrate; \"sovereign substrate an open agent stack wants\" (README)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86355","spans":[{"id":"spn-121215","marks":["bold"],"text":"Confluence / coordination-free"}]},{"id":"blk-86356","spans":[{"id":"spn-121216","text":"Order doesn't matter; replicas converge without consensus. The merge is a CvRDT."}]},{"id":"blk-86357","spans":[{"id":"spn-121217","marks":["code"],"text":"semilattice.py"},{"id":"spn-121218","text":", "},{"id":"spn-121219","marks":["code"],"text":"swarm.js"},{"id":"spn-121220","text":", CALM"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86358","spans":[{"id":"spn-121221","marks":["bold"],"text":"Knowledge over chat"}]},{"id":"blk-86359","spans":[{"id":"spn-121222","text":"The output is a "},{"id":"spn-121223","marks":["italic"],"text":"finding"},{"id":"spn-121224","text":" with evidence/provenance/confidence, not a transcript."}]},{"id":"blk-86360","spans":[{"id":"spn-121225","text":"findings board, typed deliverables"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86361","spans":[{"id":"spn-121226","marks":["bold"],"text":"Inhabitation / community"}]},{"id":"blk-86362","spans":[{"id":"spn-121227","text":"A "},{"id":"spn-121228","marks":["italic"],"text":"place"},{"id":"spn-121229","text":" with presence, movement, relationships — not a tool you invoke."}]},{"id":"blk-86363","spans":[{"id":"spn-121230","text":"\"a board its agents live on\""}]}]]},{"id":"blk-86364","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-121231","text":"3. Naming criteria"}]},{"id":"blk-86365","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-121232","text":"A. "},{"id":"spn-121233","marks":["bold"],"text":"Double meaning that encodes the thesis"},{"id":"spn-121234","text":" — best names carry the product story in the dictionary definition. B. "},{"id":"spn-121235","marks":["bold"],"text":"Place-as-noun"},{"id":"spn-121236","text":" — you can say \"open the ___\" / \"in the ___\". It must feel inhabitable. C. "},{"id":"spn-121237","marks":["bold"],"text":"Not crowded in the AI-agent / memory space"},{"id":"spn-121238","text":" (collision-checked below). D. "},{"id":"spn-121239","marks":["bold"],"text":"Sovereign tone"},{"id":"spn-121240","text":" — public, open, non-corporate. Closer to \"commons\" than \"platform\". E. "},{"id":"spn-121241","marks":["bold"],"text":"One word, pronounceable, ownable handle."}]},{"id":"blk-86366","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-121242","text":"4. Candidates + collision research (June 2026)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-86368","spans":[{"id":"spn-121243","text":"Name"}]},{"id":"blk-86369","spans":[{"id":"spn-121244","text":"Thesis fit"}]},{"id":"blk-86370","spans":[{"id":"spn-121245","text":"Collision check"}]},{"id":"blk-86371","spans":[{"id":"spn-121246","text":"Verdict"}]}],"id":"blk-86367","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-86372